      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the original design, all apexes included in the device were only flattened or non-flattened.\nBut mentioned in http://b/137629241#comment18, we need to install both flattened apex and non-flattened apex on the same device.\nSo the rest works the same as before and if mctx.Config().FlattenApex is false, we can install flattened apex by adding apex name + \".flattened\" suffix to PRODUCt_PACKAGE.\n\nAFAIK if mctx.Config().FlattenApex() is true, it means the device doesn\u0027t support .apex image type. So they must install flattened apex.",
